('help', 'Describe the issue', '<p>Include your platform, device model, operating-system and app versions, when the issue occurs, and any steps to reproduce it. Screenshots are optional.</p><p>You do not need to send passwords, identity documents, card details or advertising identifiers. Redact personal information from screenshots. For an ad issue, tell us whether it was rewarded or interstitial and whether it appeared.</p>'),
